WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.113
You do this without thinking. Your hand, on her head.

2
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:07.893
Someone did it to you.

3
00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.918
Someone did it to her.

4
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.035
[whispers] Mole, kettoo… (My girl, you hear me?)

5
00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.665
[humming] Vaavo… vaavo…

6
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.979
Ten generations of the same small love…

7
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.822
…and not one of their voices kept.

8
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:40.122
You know maybe two of their names. You'll never know how they laughed.

9
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.532
But imagine if every one of them had been kept.

10
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.115
[ten generations humming together] Vaavo… vaavo…

11
00:00:53.715 --> 00:00:55.285
[Ammamma] Mole, kettoo.

12
00:00:57.350 --> 00:01:00.489
Ten generations from now… let them hear you.

